#: manifest.json
msgid "Cut part of a video into a new file: a lossless stream copy, a re-encoded MP4, or an animated GIF or WebP"
msgstr "将视频的一段导出为新文件：无损流复制、重新编码的 MP4，或动态 GIF / WebP"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Exports part of the local video playing as a new file, from a sidebar tab, Clip Export. Fast copies the streams (lossless, about as fast as the disk, from the keyframe at or before the start); Precise re-encodes an MP4 from the exact frame, with a quality preset or your own settings, and can include the video effects and burned-in subtitles; GIF and WebP write a small looping image instead, re-encoded the same way (up to 60 seconds). Set the range by typing it, with Now, from the A-B loop, or export the last 10–120 seconds with one key. The range shows on the seek bar while the tab is open; running exports show their progress, and the last twenty clips stay in Results.\n"
"The Collection page gathers ranges from several local files into one list: reorder it, remove parts, preview a part with a double click, and export them as one merged video (Fast when the files match, Precise otherwise).\n"
"The Highlights page finds the moments the audience reacts to (stand-up, talk shows, streams, sports): laughter, applause, cheering and loud peaks. Press Find Highlights, look through the suggested ranges (each starts at the pause before its moment) and add them to the Collection. The scan runs on this computer, only when you ask for it, and is kept per file; telling laughter and applause apart needs a sound model, downloaded once (25 MB) when you choose Download and Scan, while Loudness Only works without it.\n"
"Video ▸ Export Clip… opens the tab."
msgstr ""
"在侧边栏的“片段导出”标签页中，把正在播放的本地视频的一部分导出为新文件。快速直接复制流（无损，速度接近磁盘读写，从起点处或之前的关键帧开始）；精确从准确的帧重新编码为 MP4，可选质量预设或自定义设置，并可包含视频效果和烧录字幕。GIF 和 WebP 则以同样方式重新编码，改为写出一个循环播放的小动图（最长 60 秒）。范围可以直接输入、用“当前”设定、取自 A-B 循环，也可以一键导出最近 10–120 秒。标签页打开时，范围会显示在进度条上；正在进行的导出会显示进度，最近二十个片段保留在“结果”中。\n"
"“合集”页把多个本地文件中的范围收集到一个列表里：可以调整顺序、移除片段、双击预览某一段，并把它们导出为一个合并的视频（文件一致时用快速，否则用精确）。\n"
"“高光”页找出观众有反应的片段（脱口秀、访谈、直播、体育）：笑声、掌声、欢呼和响度峰值。点“查找高光”，逐条查看建议的范围（每段从该时刻之前的停顿开始），再加入合集。扫描在这台电脑上进行，只在你要求时才开始，结果按文件保存；区分笑声和掌声需要一个声音模型，选“下载并扫描”时下载一次（25 MB），“只按响度”不需要它。\n"
"视频 ▸ 导出片段… 可打开此标签页。"

